# U242: this repo is written on Windows and half of it runs on a Raspberry Pi.
#
# A shell script checked out with CRLF fails on Linux with a message that names
# the wrong thing entirely:
#
#     env: 'bash\r': No such file or directory
#
# Anything that a Linux kernel, shell or systemd has to parse is pinned to LF,
# whatever the developer's platform prefers.
*.sh            text eol=lf
*.service       text eol=lf
*.timer         text eol=lf
Dockerfile      text eol=lf
*.bash          text eol=lf

# Deployed to the Pi and read by uv/python there; LF keeps diffs honest too.
*.py            text eol=lf
*.toml          text eol=lf
*.yml           text eol=lf
*.yaml          text eol=lf
